# Patched Plaything: the counters are only "if you cast it from your hand". Bot2's Thoughtseize makes Bot1 discard the Plaything,
# and Bot1 Reanimates it on turn 3 (losing 3 life, its mana value): it was never cast, so it enters as a full 4/3 with no
# counters, and its double strike hits Bot2 for 4 + 4 on turn 5 (Bot2, down to 18 by its own Thoughtseize, to 10).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Reanimate
Patched Plaything
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Thoughtseize
Swamp x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Thoughtseize.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Choose(Patched Plaything)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Reanimate.Cast(Patched Plaything)
[T3 Bot1.End]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Patched Plaything.Power = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Patched Plaything.Toughness = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Patched Plaything.Counters.MinusOneMinusOne = (absent)
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Patched Plaything > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 17
Bot2.Life = 10
